Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := Brankas baru: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault enkripsi: message kunci: key.
>> decrypted := vault dekripsi: encrypted kunci: key.

Keluaran 
tulis: ['Message:'], baris-baru
tulis: message, baris-baru
tulis: ['Decrypted:'], baris-baru
tulis: decrypted, baris-baru.
